#: ../../site/api/index.md:1
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API 参考"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:3
msgid ""
"The API reference is generated from the public headers under "
"`include/fincore/` with Doxygen and Breathe. Internal `fincore::detail` "
"helpers are excluded from the stable API reference. Signatures and "
"descriptions come from the same source commit as the rest of this site."
msgstr ""
"API 参考由 `include/fincore/` 下的公共头文件通过 Doxygen 和 Breathe 生成。内部 "
"`fincore::detail` 辅助实现不包含在稳定的 API 参考中。生成的签名与说明和本站点其余内容来自同一源提交。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:9
msgid ""
"A symbol appearing here means it is part of the maintained public surface. "
"It does not imply Python object compatibility, a supported platform beyond "
"the recorded acceptance evidence, or a performance guarantee."
msgstr "此处出现的符号表示它属于受维护的公共接口。它并不表示兼容 Python 对象，也不表示在已记录的验收证据之外支持某个平台，或提供任何性能保证。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:14
msgid "Modules"
msgstr "模块"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:35
msgid "How to read a reference page"
msgstr "如何阅读参考页"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:37
msgid ""
"Every module page is generated from the public header, so the order you read"
" is the order a maintainer writes:"
msgstr "每个模块页都由公共头文件生成，因此阅读顺序就是维护者的书写顺序："

#: ../../site/api/index.md:40
msgid ""
"**Signature.** Types, defaults and template parameters are literal; a "
"default is part of the contract, not a convenience."
msgstr "**签名。** 类型、默认值与模板参数都是字面契约；默认值是契约的一部分，而不是便利。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:42
msgid ""
"**Contract prose.** What the function returns, in what units, and what it "
"does with missing or non-finite values."
msgstr "**契约文字。** 函数返回什么、以什么单位返回、对缺失或非有限值如何处理。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:44
msgid ""
"**Parameters, returns and throws.** The failure modes are enumerated; each "
"one is implemented, not aspirational."
msgstr "**参数、返回值与抛出。** 失败模式被逐一列出，每一条都确实实现，而不是愿望。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:46
msgid ""
"**Ownership.** Whether a returned frame or view owns its data, and how long "
"a view stays valid."
msgstr "**所有权。** 返回的帧或视图是否拥有数据，以及视图在多长时间内有效。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:49
msgid ""
"Identifiers, commands, paths and formulas are not translated: the Chinese "
"pages carry the same declarations with Chinese explanatory prose."
msgstr "标识符、命令、路径与公式不翻译：中文页面保留同样的声明，配以中文说明文字。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:52
msgid "Conventions used by every module"
msgstr "各模块通用的约定"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:54
msgid "Timestamps are UTC nanoseconds; calendar helpers return UTC midnights."
msgstr "时间戳为 UTC 纳秒；日历辅助函数返回 UTC 零点。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:55
msgid ""
"Prices and returns are decimal fractions unless a field name says otherwise."
" Annualization is explicit in each signature."
msgstr "除非字段名称另有说明，价格与收益率均为小数。年化方式在每个签名中显式给出。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:57
msgid ""
"`dataframe` inputs and outputs follow the DataFrame submodule's column "
"rules; column names are part of each contract."
msgstr "`dataframe` 的输入与输出遵循 DataFrame 子模块的列规则；列名是各契约的一部分。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:59
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Errors carry a stable category, code and message through "
"{cpp:class}`fincore::fincore_error`; research routes add typed subclasses."
msgstr ""
"错误通过 {cpp:class}`fincore::fincore_error` 携带稳定的 category、code 与 "
"message；研究路径另有带类型的子类。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:61
msgid ""
"Optional dependencies are named at the call site; no API downloads data or "
"renders a chart implicitly."
msgstr "可选依赖在调用处显式命名；任何接口都不会隐式下载数据或渲染图表。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:64
msgid "Coverage"
msgstr "覆盖情况"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:66
msgid ""
"The public symbol ledger records every extracted symbol, its module, source "
"line and documentation status. The maintainers regenerate it with "
"`tools/build_api_ledger.py` and require either documentation or a reviewed "
"exemption for each symbol before a documentation release. The ledger itself "
"is a source artifact in the repository, so its counts can be compared "
"against the same commit."
msgstr ""
"公共符号清单记录每个被提取的符号、其模块、源码行号与文档状态。维护者使用 `tools/build_api_ledger.py` "
"重新生成它，并要求在文档发布前为每个符号提供说明或经审阅的豁免。清单本身是仓库中的源产物，因此其计数可与同一提交进行比对。"

#: ../../site/api/index.md:73
msgid ""
"The rendered signatures are the normative C++ surface. Python-compatible "
"behaviour, including exception inheritance and DataFrame object identity, is"
" described in the [migration guide](../migration.md), not inferred from the "
"generated declarations."
msgstr ""
"渲染出的签名是规范的 C++ 接口面。与 Python 兼容的行为（包括异常继承和 DataFrame "
"对象身份）在[迁移指南](../migration.md)中说明，而不是从生成的声明推断。"

