#~ msgid ""
#~ "NaN observations are dropped; the mean "
#~ "of value - risk_free is divided by"
#~ " the sample standard deviation (one "
#~ "degree of freedom) and scaled by "
#~ "sqrt(annualization). Fewer than two usable "
#~ "observations yield NaN, and a zero "
#~ "deviation is not special-cased, so "
#~ "the quotient follows IEEE rules."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "丢弃 NaN 观测；value - risk_free 的均值除以样本标准差（自由度为"
