#~ msgid ""
#~ "NaN observations are dropped; the "
#~ "annualized mean excess over required_return "
#~ "is divided by the annualized downside "
#~ "deviation, where only negative excess "
#~ "values contribute and the squared "
#~ "deviations divide by the number of "
#~ "usable observations. Fewer than two raw "
#~ "values, or no usable observation, yield "
#~ "NaN, and a zero downside deviation is"
#~ " not special-cased."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "丢弃 NaN 观测；超出 required_return "
#~ "的年化平均超额收益除以下行偏差的年化值，其中仅负超额值参与，平方偏差除以可用观测数。原始值少于两个，或没有可用观测时返回 "
#~ "NaN，零下行偏差不做特殊处理。"

